 "category": "Transition",
 "version": 1,
 "blurb": "The picture twists into a whirlpool round a point, tightest in the middle, and rushes in as it spins up to the cut; the next clip untwists out of the same spin. Put it on both clips of a cut, or use Progress to key it by hand. The picture repeats round the edges, so no gap shows.",
 "params": [
